 \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" and context id \"HALFLING_SUICIDE\". FINDING. Correction: \"以半身人身份自杀。\" target_span \"杀死敌人\".\n\nNow Q046 reconsider: \"Bringer of Doom\" → \"厄运行者\". I'll include UNCERTAIN VALUE. Actually is \"行者\" defensible? \"Bringer\" = 带来者; \"厄运行者\" reads as \"doom runner/walker\". It's a substantive mismatch in the name. But translation of proper names allows latitude... The rules say only objective defects. \"厄运行者\" doesn't convey \"bringer\". I'll report UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ043 reconsider verdict: FINDING vs UNCERTAIN. The evidence: the source line is an answer option (player's reply) following the hermit NPC's rant. Actually wait — which chat? The source match is in chat \"help\" answers, jumping to \"competition\". The help text is the hermit's plan to steal secrets. Player replies \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE.\" — commenting that the hermit's attitude (stealing, spite) isn't hermit-like. So the target's \"我这个隐士\" (me, the hermit) is a wrong referent — the speaker isn't the hermit. But is the player the hermit? The player is talking to the hermit (\"STILL CAN'T HEAR YOU\" — hmm that's proposal text; the hermit can't hear? weird). Anyway, visible evidence: the line is an answer option in a dialog where the other party says \"I DON'T EVEN WANT THE ASS-CURE FOR ME. I'M GOING TO STEAL EVERY SECRET...\" The answer responds to that. \"THAT'S\" points to the other's attitude. Target's first-person \"我这个隐士\" misattributes. I'll go FINDING, REFERENT. Hmm, but could the player character be a hermit too? No evidence. Actually risk: maybe the speaker of the option... answers are always player options. And \"THAT'S\" demonstrative refers to something else. FINDING.\n\nActually wait — reconsider: maybe the hermit is the NPC and the player says \"that's not a very hermit-like attitude\" — target \"这可不像我这个隐士该有的态度\" — could be the hermit speaking? No, it's an answer option. OK FINDING.\n\nHmm, but one more consideration: this dialog — the NPC is the hermit (Alchemist?). The player's line \"THAT'S NOT A VERY HERMIT-LIKE ATTITUDE\" mocks the NPC. Yes.\n\nQ049 verdict: I'll go with UNCERTAIN for 始终. Actually let me reconsider: \"始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示\" vs source \"When you do a mouse gesture ... a trail is displayed\". The Chinese says \"when you draw a mouse gesture with right-click drag, [always] a colored trail hint is displayed.\" Actually reading the Chinese fully: \"当你用右键拖动画出鼠标手势时，始终会显示彩色的轨迹提示。\" The \"始终\" could mean \"always (in the sense of consistently) when you do a gesture\" — i.e., every time. That reading is compatible. Hmm. \"始终会显示\" attached to the when-clause — \"whenever you do a gesture, a trail is always displayed\". That's compatible with source. So maybe not a defect. The \"提示\" (hint) addition is minor. I'll leave Q049 empty? Or UNCERTAIN. Given the reading ambiguity, \"始终\" most likely means \"consistently/each time\" here given placement after the time clause. I'll leave empty. Hmm, but it could also be read as \"always displays\". Rule 4: UNCERTAIN only when evidence points to a problem but genuine ambiguity. The ambiguity is genuine; evidence doesn't strongly point to a problem. I'll leave candidates empty with observation noting the possible ambiguity. Actually the schema requires observation min length 1; I can write a brief note.\n\nQ046: also consider \"杀死一名厄运行者\" — \"一名\" for a creature; fine.\n\nLet me also double-check Q041: \"Accept these selections\" → \"确认法术选择\". The dialog is about trap selection (traps_selected, max_traps, \"Preparing trap\"). \"法术\" (spell) contradicts trap context. FINDING SUBJECT/VALUE. I'll use claim_type SUBJECT with evidence \"self.traps_selected[tid] = not self.traps_selected[tid]\". Also \"these selections\" → \"法术选择\" loses plural \"these\"? minor. Correction: \"确认这些陷阱选择\".\n\nQ050: also check \"her arms outstretched to welcome all\" → \"她伸展双臂，欢迎所有人\" fine. Also target \"喷泉边缘反复雕着一行细小字样\" — \"a carving repeating\" — \"一行\" hmm skip.\n\nAlso Q050: check second finding? The \"德斯镇\" is main one.\n\nQ051 second: \"you need a quality ring to use a quality gem\" → \"你得寻找高品质的戒指来用于高品质的宝石。\" \"need\" → \"得寻找\" — adds \"寻找\" (find). Minor; \"你得\" = you must; \"寻找\" — \"you must find a quality ring\" vs \"you need a quality ring\". Adding \"寻找\" is mild. Skip? It changes \"have/need\" to \"search for\". Borderline; skip to be safe. Actually also \"There is a small fee dependent on the level of the ring\" → \"根据戒指等级我要收取一小笔费用\" fine.\n\nAlso Q051: \"The original traits of the ring will be lost\" → \"这颗戒指里面原来所有的属性会丢失掉\" — \"所有的\" (all) vs \"original traits\" — \"original traits\" → \"原来所有的属性\" adds \"all\". Minor. Skip.\n\nQ059 correction: source is past tense \"Removed 89 beneficial effects\" — target \"必须...清除\" changes to requirement \"must\". Hmm! Target: \"必须单次使用裂解清除敌人身上的89个增益效果\" — \"must clear 89 beneficial effects from enemies in a single use of Disintegration\". Source: \"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\" — past tense achievement desc. Target reframes as a requirement with 必须. That's another issue (ACTION/STATE). I'll report 单次 as the main finding and maybe include the 必须 rephrasing as second candidate. Two independent candidates: (1) ADDITION \"单次\"; (2) the desc rewritten as imperative requirement vs statement of accomplished fact — claim_type ACTION, target_span \"必须单次使用裂解清除\", correction \"使用裂解从敌人身上移除了 89 个增益效果\". Evidence for (2): \"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\" Both fine. But maybe keep just one to avoid overreach? Rule 5 encourages multiple independent candidates. I'll include both. Actually, achievement descriptions in ToME are typically statements of what was done; but some Chinese translations convert to requirement style... The source is declarative past. I'll include as UNCERTAIN for the 必须 one? Hmm. The counter track \" / 89\" supports cumulative. I'll make candidate 1 FINDING (单次), candidate 2 UNCERTAIN (declarative vs requirement). Actually, converting to \"必须\" changes it into a task description — many official translations do this. I'll mark UNCERTAIN.\n\nQ056: also \"弗……特……玛……尔……\" vs \"f...t...ma....ll...\" — target renders as 弗尔特玛尔; \"ll\" → 尔? \"ma\" → 玛, \"ll\" → 尔 — dropping one syllable? Eh, skip.\n\nQ053: leave empty.\n\nQ042, Q045, Q048, Q052, Q054: empty.\n\nNow count items Q041–Q060 = 20. Good.\n\nFor Q058 evidence verbatim check: source_context contains: \"if p and config.settings.cheat then list[#list+1] = {name=_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", action=\\\"debug-inspect\\\", color=colors.simple(colors.LIGHT_BLUE), actor=p} end\" — I'll use substring \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\" which appears verbatim. Also other entries like \"if a and config.settings.cheat then\" appear; using \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\" is specific to projectile. Good.\n\nQ057 evidence: \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\" verbatim in source. Good.\n\nQ060 evidence: \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\" verbatim in source. Also context \"HALFLING_SUICIDE\". Use source text.\n\nQ055 evidence verbatim: \"Did the righteous thing in the ring of blood and disposed of the Blood Master.\" — appears within desc. Good.\n\nQ056 evidence verbatim: \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" — check exact characters: \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\" Yes.\n\nQ044 evidence: \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\" — appears in source. Yes.\n\nQ047 evidence: \"ruined from your fight with the creature carrying it\" verbatim in source. Yes.\n\nQ041 evidence: \"self.traps_selected[tid] = not self.traps_selected[tid]\" verbatim. Yes.\n\nQ043 evidence: need verbatim. The answer: {_t\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\", jump=\"competition\"}, — I'll use \"{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"competition\\\"}\" which appears verbatim. And correction: \"这可不太像隐士的态度。\" Also claim REFERENT.\n\nQ050 evidence: \"name = _t\\\"Angolwen Fountain\\\",\" verbatim appears? In context: \"name = _t\\\"Angolwen Fountain\\\",\" yes. Also \"id = \\\"angolwen-fountain\\\",\". Use \"name = _t\\\"Angolwen Fountain\\\",\" — verbatim including comma. Yes it appears as `\\tname = _t\"Angolwen Fountain\",`. Good.\n\nQ051 evidence: \"If you bring me a gem and a ring, I can create a new ring imbued with the properties of the gem.\" verbatim in source. Good.\n\nQ059 evidence: \"self.nb = (self.nb or 0) + 1\" verbatim appears (in can_gain). Also \"if self.nb >= 89 then return true end\". Use the latter: \"if self.nb >= 89 then return true end\" verbatim. Good — supports cumulative threshold.\n\nQ046 UNCERTAIN: target_span \"厄运行者\", evidence \"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\", correction \"杀死一名带来厄运者／厄运使者\". Fine.\n\nNow Q049 observation: note that \"始终\" could read as \"every time\"; no candidates.\n\nWrite JSON.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"```json\n{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q041\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"SUBJECT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"法术选择\",\n          \"correction\": \"确认这些（陷阱）选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"self.traps_selected[tid] = not self.traps_selected[tid]\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示该选项用于确认已选中的陷阱（traps_selected、max_traps、\\\"Preparing trap\\\"），target 将其译为“法术选择”，把 traps 误作 spells，主体对象错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q042\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“Got to level 10 of the infinite dungeon.” 与“到达无尽地下城第10层。”数值、地点与动作一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q043\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"我这个隐士\",\n          \"correction\": \"这可不太像隐士该有的态度。\",\n          \"evidence\": \"{_t\\\"[[SOURCE_MATCH_1]]\\\", jump=\\\"competition\\\"}\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 是玩家对隐士 NPC 的回答选项（\\\"THAT'S...\\\" 指向对方的行事态度），target 用第一人称“我这个隐士”把隐士身份指到说话者自己身上，指称对象被改变。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q044\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"200 面墙\",\n          \"correction\": \"100 面墙\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Have 100 walls on the sludgenest turn into hostile creatures.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确为 100 面墙，target 译为 200 面墙，数值错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q045\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"截断语句“But what is all th...”与“但是这一切到底是……”语义相符，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q046\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"厄运行者\",\n          \"correction\": \"带来厄运者／降厄者\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Killed a Bringer of Doom.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"“Bringer of Doom”中的 Bringer（带来者）在“厄运行者”中未体现，且“行者”（行走者）为新增含义；因属专有名词译法，存在一定裁量空间，故列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q047\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"那个人类\",\n          \"correction\": \"携带纸片的那个生物\",\n          \"evidence\": \"ruined from your fight with the creature carrying it\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 只说“the creature carrying it”（携带纸片的生物），未指明为人类；source_context 全篇围绕蜘蛛（arachnids、\\\"that spider is the matriarch here\\\"），target 译为“那个人类”与可见证据相悖。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q048\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“Records of Lorekeeper Hadak part three”与“博学者哈达克的记录，第三部分”对应一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q049\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“始终”紧跟“当你……画出鼠标手势时”，可解读为“每次做手势时都会显示”，与 source 的条件句相容；无法由可见证据判定为缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q050\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"位于德斯镇\",\n          \"correction\": \"删除“位于德斯镇”（或改为与安格列文相符的表述）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"name = _t\\\"Angolwen Fountain\\\",\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 原文未提及喷泉所在城镇，target 新增“位于德斯镇”；source_context 显示该 lore 为 \\\"angolwen-fountain\\\" / \\\"Angolwen Fountain\\\"，新增信息与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q051\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"一枚项链\",\n          \"correction\": \"一枚戒指\",\n          \"evidence\": \"If you bring me a gem and a ring, I can create a new ring imbued with the properties of the gem.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 明确要求带来“a gem and a ring”（宝石和戒指），target 将第一个 ring 误译为“项链”，与同句后文的“戒指”自相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q052\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"target 新增的“兽人”是对 they 的具体化；可见文本（Sher'Tuls）既无法证实也无法证伪该指称，依据规则不构成可报告缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q053\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“Return in a few days, and I'll have everything prepared”与“几天后你回来，我肯定把一切都准备好了”在中文语境下可作将来完成解读，其余信息均对应，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q054\",\n      \"candidates\": [],\n      \"observation\": \"“I cleared the room of death and all I got was this lousy achievement!”与译文语义一致，未发现客观缺陷。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q055\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"放走鲜血大师\",\n          \"correction\": \"除掉鲜血大师才是正确的选择\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Did the righteous thing in the ring of blood and disposed of the Blood Master.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 显示该成就（RING_BLOOD_KILL）因“disposed of the Blood Master”（除掉鲜血大师）而获得，target 译为“放走鲜血大师”，动作方向完全相反。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q056\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"REFERENT\",\n          \"target_span\": \"弗莉吉亚的弟弟\",\n          \"correction\": \"一个人类（战甲中其实是弗莉吉亚的父亲）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Father... #LIGHT_GREEN#*She stands silent for a few seconds*#WHITE# You win, @playerdescriptor.race@.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 原文仅说“it's actually a human inside that hulking, worn armor”；target 具体化为“弗莉吉亚的弟弟”，而 source_context 中弗莉吉亚在 Valfren 被击败后称其为“Father”，可见证据指向父亲而非弟弟。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q057\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"VALUE\",\n          \"target_span\": \"地图和角色\",\n          \"correction\": \"区域和层级\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Reload/regenerate Zone and level\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 为“Zone and level”（区域与关卡层级），target 将 level 误译为“角色”，指称对象错误。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q058\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"即使此处没有抛射物，也可在 Lua 中查看\",\n          \"correction\": \"Lua 查看 [抛射物]\",\n          \"evidence\": \"if p and config.settings.cheat then\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 仅为调试菜单项“Lua inspect [Projectile]”；source_context 显示该菜单项仅在存在抛射物（if p ...）时加入列表，target 新增的“即使此处没有抛射物”与可见证据相矛盾。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q059\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ADDITION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"单次\",\n          \"correction\": \"删除“单次”：使用裂解从敌人身上清除了89个增益效果\",\n          \"evidence\": \"if self.nb >= 89 then return true end\"\n        },\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"UNCERTAIN\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"ACTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"必须单次使用裂解清除\",\n          \"correction\": \"已通过裂解从敌人身上移除了89个增益效果\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Removed 89 beneficial effects from enemies via Disintegration.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source_context 的 can_gain 以累计计数器（self.nb 逐次 +1，达到 89 即达成，并显示“/ 89”）判定，说明并非要求单次完成，“单次”为与证据相悖的新增条件；另外 source 为陈述已达成事实的完成时描述，target 改写为“必须……”的要求式表述，方向有偏但属常见改写，列为 UNCERTAIN。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"neutral_id\": \"Q060\",\n      \"candidates\": [\n        {\n          \"verdict\": \"FINDING\",\n          \"claim_type\": \"DIRECTION\",\n          \"target_span\": \"杀死敌人\",\n          \"correction\": \"杀死自己（以半身人身份自杀）\",\n          \"evidence\": \"Killed oneself as a halfling.\"\n        }\n      ],\n      \"observation\": \"source 描述半身人杀死自己（成就 id 为 HALFLING_SUICIDE），target 译为“杀死敌人”，动作对象方向完全相反。\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"zai-standard-cn","model":"glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":10810,"output":9427,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":7044,"totalTokens":20237,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1787984354398,"responseId":"20260829141914fa3a872babea4664","rawStopReason":"stop"}],"willRetry":false}
